 "promptBase": {
  "image": {
   "style-1": "Vertical 9:16 poster composition, mobile safe zone. Clean pure white background (#FFFFFF) with a soft cool-white corner gradient (#F3F6FC), flat matte, subtle thin square grid in pale blue-gray (#E3E9F5), exactly 2 faint diagonal background lines in soft blue-gray (#D5E0F7) at 12% opacity. Palette: vivid blue #1F5FFF, deep navy #0B1B3A, white, light sky blue #BBD0FF only for glow and shadow. Premium editorial look, soft studio light from upper left, gentle blue-tinted directional shadows, one organic pale-blue corner shape.",
   "style-2": "Vertical 9:16 poster composition, mobile safe zone. Clean pure white background (#FFFFFF) with a soft cool-white corner gradient (#F3F6FC), flat matte, subtle thin square grid in pale blue-gray (#E3E9F5), exactly 2 faint diagonal background lines in soft blue-gray (#D5E0F7) at 12% opacity. Palette: vivid blue #1F5FFF, deep navy #0B1B3A, white, light sky blue #BBD0FF only for glow and shadow. Premium editorial look, soft studio light from upper left, gentle blue-tinted directional shadows, one organic pale-blue corner shape."
  },
  "motion": {
   "style-1": "Timing per scene: 0.0-0.5s OPEN; 0.5-3.5s KINETIC BUILD; 3.5-4.7s MICRO-MOTION & HOLD; 4.7-6.0s OUTRO. Background: Exactly 2 soft translucent diagonal lines move slowly and independently behind everything. Motion styles used: 2.5D Mixed-Media Floating Grid, Surreal Cutout Collage, Kinetic Typography Staging, Dynamic 2.5D Collage with kinetic text. Camera: Subtle push-in.; Gentle Z-axis drift forward.; Static with a slight parallax between bust and background.",
   "style-2": "Timing per scene: 0.0-0.5s OPEN; 0.5-3.5s KINETIC BUILD; 3.5-4.7s MICRO-MOTION & HOLD; 4.7-6.0s OUTRO. Background: Exactly 2 soft translucent diagonal lines move slowly and independently behind everything. Motion styles used: 2.5D Mixed-Media Floating Grid, Surreal Cutout Collage, Kinetic Serif-Free Staging (bold sans), Kinetic Typography Staging. Camera: Subtle push-in.; Gentle Z-axis drift forward.; Static with slight parallax."
